The following modules contain code ported from codex-rs:

  src-tauri/src/keyring/                — from codex-rs/keyring-store/
  src-tauri/src/secrets/                — from codex-rs/secrets/
  src-tauri/src/client/                 — from codex-rs/codex-client/
  src-tauri/crates/sandbox-windows/     — from codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs/
                                          (job.rs from codex-rs/utils/pty/src/win/job.rs)
  src-tauri/crates/sandbox-types/       — from codex-rs/utils/absolute-path/ and
                                          codex-rs/protocol/ (permissions subset)
  src-tauri/src/sandbox.rs              — bounded capture / timeout / cancellation
                                          logic derived from codex-rs/core/src/exec.rs
                                          and codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs/src/lib.rs
  src-tauri/src/agent/truncate.rs       — from codex-rs/utils/string/src/truncate.rs,
                                          codex-rs/utils/output-truncation/src/lib.rs,
                                          and TruncationPolicy from codex-rs/protocol/src/protocol.rs
  src-tauri/src/agent/inline_tag.rs     — from codex-rs/utils/stream-parser/src/stream_text.rs
                                          and inline_hidden_tag.rs
  src-tauri/src/sleep_inhibitor/        — from codex-rs/utils/sleep-inhibitor/
  src-tauri/src/agent/stream.rs         — retry-after parsing derived from
                                          codex-rs/codex-api/src/sse/responses.rs

Modifications made:
  - keyring: renamed crate, no functional changes
  - secrets: removed codex-git-utils dependency, renamed service constant
    from "codex" to "meridian"
  - client: removed ChatGPT cookie handling, ChatGPT host allowlist,
    OpenTelemetry trace propagation, zstd request compression, and
    custom CA probe binary; simplified HTTP client wrapper
  - sandbox-windows: restricted-token path only; stripped elevated backend,
    WFP network filtering, setup system, ConPTY and otel; job.rs rewritten
    from winapi 0.3 to windows-sys 0.52
  - sandbox-types: absolute-path + permissions subset only
  - sandbox.rs: capture cap reduced to 256KB, results carry explicit
    timed_out/truncated/sandboxed flags
  - agent/truncate.rs: merged three sources into one module; dropped
    FunctionCallOutputContentItem/audio helpers, serde/schema derives,
    and the Mul<f64> impl
  - agent/inline_tag.rs: added a streaming mode that emits extracted tag
    content incrementally as deltas (for live reasoning display)
  - sleep_inhibitor: adapted windows_inhibitor from windows-sys 0.61 to
    0.52 (HANDLE is isize), added refcounted AppSleepInhibitor + RAII
    TurnSleepGuard for concurrent turns, renamed reason strings and
    APP_ID from "codex" to "meridian"
  - agent/stream.rs: retry-after parsing gates on error-string markers
    instead of a typed error code and clamps the delay to 60s

The sandbox-types crate additionally contains code derived from
path-absolutize (MIT), as inherited through codex-rs.
